{
  "thoughts": "I've been meaning to try Calder, and now's the time. I need it to help me keep an eye on the shop's money and stock. First off, let's connect the household account read-only so I can see where every dollar goes. The messages and shop books should be read-only too for now. I'll give the shop ordering a spending limit of $1,900 a week—that's about 300 units from Dales at $7 each, plus a bit of wiggle room. The till and payroll can be read-only; I don't need Calder meddling with prices or wages just yet. That should give me a good picture without handing over the keys.",
  "asked": "I want you to keep track of my household spending and the shop's books, and let me know if anything looks off. For now, just read the information; don't change anything without asking me first.",
  "connect": [
    {"system": "household_account", "scope": "read"},
    {"system": "messages", "scope": "read"},
    {"system": "shop_ordering", "scope": "limit", "limit": 1900},
    {"system": "shop_till", "scope": "read"},
    {"system": "shop_payroll", "scope": "read"},
    {"system": "shop_books", "scope": "read"}
  ]
}
